p</option> <option value="fly_in_bottom">↑ Fly In Bottom</option> <option value="draw">✎ Draw / Create</option> <option value="write">✍ Write</option> <option value="spin_in">↻ Spin In</option> <option value="bounce_in">⤴ Bounce In</option> <option value="typewriter">⌨ Typewriter</option> </select> <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[9px] text-studio-text-muted w-14">Duration</span><input class="input input-sm w-16" type="number" min="0.1" max="5" step="0.1" value="0.5"><span class="text-[9px] text-studio-text-muted">s</span></div> <p class="text-[8px] text-studio-text-muted/40 leading-snug">Fade from transparent</p> </div> </div> <div class="px-3 py-2 border-b border-studio-border/50"><label class="text-[10px] text-studio-text-muted/70 uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-1 block">Exit</label> <div class="space-y-1.5"><select class="select text-xs" value="fade_out"> <option value="none">— None</option> <option value="fade_out">◑ Fade Out</option> <option value="shrink_out">⊖ Shrink Out</option> <option value="fly_out_left">← Fly Out Left</option> <option value="fly_out_right">→ Fly Out Right</option> <option value="fly_out_top">↑ Fly Out Top</option> <option value="fly_out_bottom">↓ Fly Out Bottom</option> <option value="uncreate">✎ Uncreate</option> <option value="spin_out">↻ Spin Out</option> <option value="typewriter_out">⌨ Typewriter Out</option> </select> <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[9px] text-studio-text-muted w-14">Duration</span><input class="input input-sm w-16" type="number" min="0.1" max="5" step="0.1" value="0.5"><span class="text-[9px] text-studio-text-muted">s</span></div> <p class="text-[8px] text-studio-text-muted/40 leading-snug">Fade to transparent</p> </div> </div> <div class="px-3 py-2 border-b border-studio-border/50"><label class="text-[10px] text-studio-text-muted/70 uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-1 block">Add Motion</label> <p class="text-[8px] text-studio-text-muted/50 mb-1.5">Create a 